Figure 6: Data Cleaning and Preparation Steps\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\fs36 \cf0 Overview\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Figure 6 presents an interrupted time series analysis of the monthly active liver transplant waitlist census (January 2015\'96December 2024), with August 2023 as the time of intervention. Joinpoint regression was used to estimate preintervention knots, and segmented regression with Newey\'96West robust standard errors was used to estimate slope change following the inflection in overdose decedent donor transplant rates. Analysis details are described in the manuscript Methods section.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

