\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 Step 5: Merge with Institution File\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Merge the file from Step 4 with 
\f2\fs26 institution.sas7bdat
\f1\fs24  to add transplant center variables, including the listing center's state.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
