Puerto_Rico_Listing = 0  OTHERWISE\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs24 \cf0 Filter to 
\f2\fs26 Puerto_Rico_Listing = 0
\f1\fs24 .\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 2,479 rows with Puerto Rico listings were excluded
\f1\b0  
\f0\b Expected N = 1,701,735 rows after exclusion
\f1\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 Step 7: Save as CSV\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Save the filtered file as CSV for R processing. The R code for computing monthly active waitlist size (counting unique 
\f2\fs26 PERS_ID
\f1\fs24  with any status code except 6999 in each month) and for the interrupted time series analysis is provided separately.\
